<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n25063" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Ismēnus</span></b>  or <b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">-ŏs</span></b> , i, m., = <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ἰσμηνός,</span>
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>a river of
				Bœotia</i>, <i>near Thebes</i>, <i><span class="en">Plin. 4, 7,
				12, § 25</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Ov. M. 2,
				244</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Stat. Th. 1, 40</span></i>; <i><span class="en">9,
			404</span></i>.— </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b> Derivv. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>A.</b>
			<b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Ismēnĭus</span></b> ,
				a, um, adj., 
			 = <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ἰσμήνιος,</span>
			<i>of</i> or <i>belonging to
			Ismenus</i>, <i>Ismenian</i>, <b>poet.</b> for <i>Theban</i>, <i><span class="en">Ov. M. 13,
				682</span></i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">heros,</span>”
				i. e. <i>Polynices</i>,
				 <i><span class="en">Stat.
					Th. 2, 307</span></i>
			.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>B.</b>
			<b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Ismēnis</span></b> ,
				ĭdis, f., = <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ἰσμηνίς,</span>
			<i>a Theban woman</i>, <i><span class="en">Ov. M. 3,
				169</span></i>; <i><span class="en">733</span></i>; <i><span class="en">4, 31</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
